{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:45:647","content":{"id":647,"title":"SVG 介绍","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"5efcddb7-8173-45c3-b267-4275b645bf43","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"概念"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6560e01c-f1a2-4113-ba11-722e24634e90","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 全称为 Scalable Vector Graphics（可缩放矢量图），它是一种图像格式，使用形状、路径等来组成图像内容，与一般由像素描述的图像不同，SVG 可以做到与分辨率无关的清晰度，无论放大多少倍，图像还是一样的清晰。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"538f2278-ff72-4ceb-a01f-8acda8f1deee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为 SVG 与分辨率无关，所以我们经常使用 SVG 制作 icon，可以在各个平台进行使用，不用准备 2x，3x 不同尺寸的图。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"61cfab59-2a9a-4170-a897-2c5c30fd6380","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除此之外，SVG 还有很多优点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"3da258ad-4a02-481b-b361-172332266c04","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a24d615b-af1a-4167-9e68-51a79a4e0bf4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"182a6bc7-417f-4a68-85e2-cf1e8e8c5234","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 是文本文件，可以直接打开使用编辑器进行修改"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8c6b012e-d1ca-45e3-8e1c-2f4390fdfb5d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b225ac4-e865-473e-b3cd-b91c183ea550","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比于 PNG、JPEG、GIF，具有更小的尺寸"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7f6bf13c-04d7-4f1d-b176-f76b8702e86c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d46662c1-1771-48a0-9287-a6d493991a13","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 中的文字可以被选中"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"99ac64a0-cbbe-4c08-a8c9-7f350c0a7d91","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"664ab552-21e4-436f-ab3a-5054716ea455","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持动画，可以通过 SMIL 或者 CSS 使得 SVG 中的元素产生动画效果"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ae710405-7e19-4f6c-8c46-ba5ccf7d9a10","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"af703c0b-fe47-45e9-8f6e-4056b3eca861","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"..."}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"04194e7b-7179-49da-85d2-0ee4c43b7cbf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"840b0e42-7093-447e-bc71-ea4bd031a378","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 作为一种图片，我们可以直接通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"img"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者在 CSS 中通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"background-image"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行引用"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"ecb72025-eea5-4d30-be5c-7df899bb7897","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"84e2aa27-39f8-4082-8bb4-67f6a601bbef","children":[{"type":"